# Generation kinds

- Register every kind in `jobs/registry.py`: pipeline, params_cls, build, expand, upload_refs, title, work_units.
- `queue.py` and retry dispatch only through the registry — no new `if g.kind == ...` branches.
- Persist via shared `persist_generation` / post-process create helper; do not copy double-commit `filename_prefix`.
- Graph builders share `_link`; enhance/interpolate share `_resolve`.
- Keep parity: workflow JSON + builder + `test_builder_*` must stay green.
